  "description": "The top text overlay 'the definition of utter disgust' is directly mapped onto the visual entity 'man' (the Black man). The meme uses the intimate pose of the Black man to visually represent the textual claim that he embodies 'utter disgust', creating an analogical mapping where the man is equated with the concept of disgust. This is a hateful mapping that dehumanizes the man by associating him with a negative emotional state.",
